# Seven-page annual report of a renewable energy cooperative. There are two sections: the
# cover, full bleed (Margin: 0), without a page number and without the document footer (Inherit page overlays: false),
# and the body, numbered from 1 ("Page 1 of 6" on the first inside page). It also shows key figures
# in a grid, charts as images, two-column text with a rule, a financial table with
# header and footer, and chapters that always start on a new page. The contents page is a Table of contents:
# it lists the chapters with their printed page, which the engine computes. The titles of the cover and of
# the contents page are a Heading 1 with In table of contents: false, to keep them out of the contents, and with
# Numbered: false, so that they do not count. The chapters are numbered Heading 1 (Numbered: true in
# styles.stxt: 1 to 6) and their sections, Heading 2 (1.1, 2.1...); the contents and the PDF bookmarks carry the
# number. The labels are written in lowercase and the rules put them in uppercase, with a little
# letter spacing (Case).
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
