			Heading 2:
				Text: Monthly production
			Image: examples/report/en/chart-production.svg
				Id: chart-production
				Alt: Bar chart of the monthly production in 2025, in MWh: from 98 in December to 306 in July
				Box:
					Width: 100%
			Text: Monthly renewable energy production in 2025, in MWh. The peak, in July, with 306 MWh.
				Style: caption
			Paragraph: Production follows the curve of the sun: from November to January it drops below 125 MWh, and between May and August it exceeds 250. Wind partly makes up for the winter, which is why adding a fourth wind turbine, planned for 2026, is one of our priorities.
		Block:
			Id: customers
			Style: section
			Heading 1:
				Text: Customers and community
			Paragraph: A cooperative exists for those who use it. This year we served 8,412 customers, 46% of them households.
				Style: lead
			Columns:
				Id: community
				Count: 2
				Gap: 26
				Separator: 0.5
				Separator color: #C9D5E3
				Box:
					Margin: 0 0 14 0
				Markdown:
					Bullet markers: bullet
					Content >>
						## Households

						We added 412 households, most of them in Garrotxa villages that had no local supply offer. The **stable price** tariff held all year, including the winter months.

						## Shops and businesses

						A third of our non-residential customers are bakeries, workshops and small industries that cover part of their consumption with the solar installation we fitted on their roof.

						## Energy communities

						We supported the creation of **five local energy communities**, in which neighbors share the production of a single roof. Each one received free training and legal advice.

						## Solidarity fund

						One percent of our turnover goes to a fund that pays the bills of families in vulnerable situations: this year, 61 households.
