					| Sant Joan expansion | 310 | 0.6 MWp |
					| Wind turbine repowering | 190 | 0.9 MW |
					| Community warehouse batteries | 70 | 0.2 MWh |
			Text: 100% of the investment was financed with contributions from members, with no debt to financial institutions.
