				Text: Every kilowatt-hour we produce here is one that does not have to be brought from far away, or burned.
			Heading 2:
				Text: Commitments for 2026
			List:
				Marker: decimal
				List item:
					Paragraph: Exceed 2,700 MWh of production with the fourth wind turbine and the Les Preses expansion.
				List item:
					Paragraph: Cut the emissions of the maintenance vehicle fleet to zero; today it has two diesel vans.
				List item:
					Paragraph: Publish the carbon footprint of the whole supplier chain, with the help of the university.
				List item:
					Paragraph: Plant four thousand native trees on land provided by the town councils of the county.
